clean, `tracecheck` exit 0 (acceptance_cases=94, unchanged). Dirnode cover 74.9% → 83.3%.\\n- STATUS: Ready for review, handed off uncommitted.\\n\\n### 0930 — Directory-node leaf: `internal/dirnode` implemented with enumerated census first\\n\\n- SCOPE: TASK-260830-ljkj8r (second leaf of STORY-260830-3drr2m). New package `internal/dirnode`: two-major manifest bootstrap, envelope framing, manifest/probe/scan/Directory-Query framing, façade host checks, Structured Error 1.2.0 refusals. Six traceability rows (88 → 94), README paragraph. Uncommitted per the CR-shape instruction.\\n- CENSUS FIRST: the leaf-1 lesson (seven rounds, one repeating mistake class) is applied before the battery, not after. `census_test.go` enumerates 10 of 10 AST shapes carrying an error construction (literal, binary-expr with rendered key, constructor registration, New-outside-body, New-as-value, ctor alias in every position, closure-hidden call, aliased import, frameFault literal) with synthetic proofs and named residue. Result: 147 derived arms (145 witnessed + 2 defensive), 8 constructors. The census caught 5 missing witness rows and 3 vacuous fixture vectors during authoring.\\n- NO-OP-PROOF VECTORS: every fixture-surgery site uses `replaceOnce`, which fails when the needle is absent — a mutation that changes nothing can no longer pass against a still-valid body.\\n- FINDINGS: (1) §10.8.5 prose names `query_cursor_mismatch` but the pinned error registry does not register it — cursor reuse refuses as `query_invalid` with a cursor-mismatch detail. (2) The response envelope carries its own `schema` + `schema_version` (1.0.0 both majors): the downgrade tuple names a response schema_version no schemaless reading can carry. (3) `node manifest is not canonical JSON` is reachable, not defensive: extensions values cross opaquely while the canonicalizer enforces depth 256 (300-deep vector proves it). (4) `failCapability` removed — no entry point in this deliverable raises `capability_unavailable`; the taxonomy test pins the 8 emitted codes instead of keeping a dead constructor for census symmetry.\\n- EVIDENCE: narrowing-mutant battery M1–M8, all killed, 0 survivors (M1 downgrade-retryable, M2 v1-macos, M3 conditional-upgrade, M4 scan-replay, M5 index-contiguity, M6 relabeled-schema-version, M7 reasonless-capability, M8 aliased-import with full behavioral suite green). Every mutant copy-aside/copy-back with `cmp` clean; exit codes unpiped. Census-only kills (M8's 4) scored separately.\\n- GATES: `go test ./... -count=1` exit 0 (18 pkgs), `-count=3` and `-race` on dirnode exit 0, `-race` on traceability+tracecheck exit 0, `go vet ./...` and `GOOS=windows go vet ./...` exit 0, gofmt clean, `tracecheck` exit 0 (acceptance_cases=94). Full-repo `-race` not run (exceeds one bounded call; raced every touched package instead). Dirnode cover 75.0%.\\n- STATUS: Ready for review, handed off uncommitted.\\n\\n### 0618 — Session-adapter leaf round-4 rework: rev3 B4/B5/B6 closed as classes, N6 fixed in code\\n\\n- SCOPE: TASK-260830-2z3se0 round-4 rework (review-verdict-rev3, changes requested, B4–B6 blocking + N6). Test-only additions inside `internal/sessadapter/` (`zero_absent_test.go`, `bounds_edge_test.go`, `import_census_test.go`) plus a two-line production-test fix in `inventory_test.go` and this entry. No production behavior change; the 323-arm inventory floor is untouched. Uncommitted per the CR-shape instruction.\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 8621,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 2156,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
