{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000e0ad","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a07664-b32a-7b03-be28-978067559ac9"},"sequence":3761,"recorded_at":1780531400007517,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"4279c805-073c-4405-a747-7b1a47e438ac","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"4279c805-073c-4405-a747-7b1a47e438ac","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"4279c805-073c-4405-a747-7b1a47e438ac"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"d86e8002-dd9a-4e07-a13a-59dcb03e72b9"},"task_id":"d86e8002-dd9a-4e07-a13a-59dcb03e72b9","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"d86e8002-dd9a-4e07-a13a-59dcb03e72b9","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 6-8\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-## 2026-09-06\n-\n-### 1347 — Shared-environment boundary leaf: one library plus fail-closed agreement battery\n+## 2026-09-06\n+\n+### 1553 — Shared-environment boundary round-2 rework: admit hole closed by delegation, shape census, 27-mutant battery\n+- SCOPE: TASK-260830-3bkz0c round-2 rework (review-verdict-rev3, B1/B2/F1/F2 blocking + B2b). Freeze on sessadapter/dirnode production lifted for exactly this fix. Production: sessadapter/dirnode decodeStrictObject delegate frame verdicts to environ.DecodeStrictObject (fault translation only); buggy hasLoneSurrogateEscape/readUTF16Escape copies deleted; environ.rawUint53 hardened with trailing-data check; dead environ.validCapability deleted. Tests: frame corpus proves both directions (3 composed rows added, 7 verdicts flipped with absent-phrase pins), shape census (25 rows) + 14 synthetic controls + grammar fresh-name rule + delegation pin, environ unit tests for uint53/sorted-strings-halves/Fault rendering, both leaves' arm censuses derive the bridge from environ source.\n+- FINDING (B2): witness `\\\\ud800\\udc00` (escaped backslash + literal ud800 + real lone low) admitted by sessadapter.DecodeTuple (Version rewritten to `\\\\ud800`+U+FFFD) and dirnode.CheckScanRequest while environ/canonicaljson/provhost refused — the raw scan misread quoted text as a high surrogate and paired it with the following real escape. Closed by delegation, not by widening the scan. All five judges refuse post-fix (probe logs kept).\n+- FINDING (corpus one-sidedness): frameCorpus sampled backslash-run parity but never an even run WITH a following real escape — green over the hole. The corpus now proves both directions: run-parity rows (over-strict side, verdicts flipped to member arms with frame phrase absent) plus even-run-plus-real-escape compositions (admit-hole side).\n+- FINDING (B1): live-planted all 7 reviewer shapes into internal/provider — old name census caught 2/7 (ledgered-name func/method); new name+shape census catches 7/7 plus a fresh-name grammar copy (evidence log kept). Shape census also surfaced 5 canonicaljson rune measures and scalar's third-spelling raw-scan gate that the name census never saw; scalar/provhost/canonicaljson copies ledgered as unification residue in TASK-260906-33xcnc.\n+- FINDING (F1/F2): environ had zero production callers and 6 functions at 0%; now DecodeStrictObject/HasLoneSurrogateEscape are called from both facades, coverage 76.1%→89.8%, no function at 0%. Denominator re-derived from production: 31 refuse arms + 58 boolean exits = 89. Battery: 27 applied / 27 killed (26 narrowing + token-preserving T1 with census green and 7 behavioral rows reddening); 22 of 89 exits directly killed, 67 residue stated by function.\n+- FINDING (new, fixed): environ.rawUint53 admitted `12a` as 12 (Decoder reads one value and stops); covered by new M4 mutant + trailing check. Sibling sessadapter/dirnode/provhost copies share the texture but are unreachable via production paths (frame gates first) — tracked in TASK-260906-33xcnc, not fixed here.\n+- EVIDENCE: attached TASK-260830-3bkz0c_round2.md (5-judge witness table, 7/7 live-plant proof, 27-row mutant table, residue table, AC mapping) + updated TASK-260830-3bkz0c_boundary.md. Follow-up TASK-260906-33xcnc created and referenced.\n+- GATES: `go test ./... -count=1 -p 2` exit 0 (19 pkgs), environ `-race` exit 0, cover 89.8%, `go vet ./...` + `GOOS=windows go vet` (3 pkgs) exit 0, gofmt clean, `tracecheck` exit 0 (94 cases, unchanged), `go build ./...` exit 0.\n+- STATUS: Ready for review, handed off to review (review/landing are orchestrator steps).\n+\n+### 1347 — Shared-environment boundary leaf: one library plus fail-closed agreement battery\n"}}}
